-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z\"></path></svg></button><button class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-gray-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors duration-200\" aria-label=\"Share via Email\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 4H4c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L2 18c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V6c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 4l-8 5-8-5V6l8 5 8-5v2z\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-2 pb-8 relative\"><article class=\"prose prose-lg prose-gray max-w-none mx-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-none text-center\"><div class=\"text-left inline-block w-full\"><h1 class=\"text-xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 mt-6 leading-tight\">2024's Innovation Rewind at Buildora</h1>\n<p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 font-normal\"><strong>2024 was an incredible kickstart for us!</strong></p>\n<p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 font-normal\">As 2024 wraps up, I wanted to share what we've been cooking up at <a href=\"/host\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline font-medium\">Buildora</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 font-normal\"><strong>Quick highlight:</strong> We've been busy turning caffeine into code and wild ideas into reality through our Hackathons and Innovation Programs. Think of it as professional chaos-coordination with amazing results!</p>\n<p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 font-normal\">I truly enjoyed our conversation earlier this year and would love to explore how we might collaborate in 2025. Whether it's amplifying innovation in your space or just bouncing around ideas over coffee, I'm all ears.</p>\n<p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 font-normal\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7278383763317764096\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline font-medium\">Check out Buildora's rewind 2024</a></p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 leading-tight\">A Big Thank you</h2>\n<p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 font-normal\">A Big Thank you to our partner brands and the amazing community of tech builders who made this journey possible. 2025 is calling and we promise to host more &amp; more impactful innovations and hackathon programs.</p>\n<p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 font-normal\">Happy 2025 &amp; a new beginning!</p>\n<p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 font-normal\">Best Regards,<br>\nTeam Buildora</p>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-gray-200\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 leading-tight\">Community of Tech Builders</h2>\n<p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 font-normal\">Buildora continues to be the community of tech builders shipping through hackathons. Our mission remains focused on creating platforms where innovation meets opportunity, and where the next generation of tech leaders can showcase their skills and build meaningful solutions.</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3 leading-tight\">What's Next in 2025</h3>\n<p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 font-normal\">As we look forward to 2025, we're excited to:</p>\n<ul class=\"space-y-2 mb-4 pl-0\">\n<li class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed ml-8 list-disc\">Host more impactful hackathon programs</li>\n<li class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed ml-8 list-disc\">Expand our community of tech builders</li>\n<li class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed ml-8 list-disc\">Create new opportunities for innovation</li>\n<li class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed ml-8 list-disc\">Partner with more organizations to drive technological advancement</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 font-normal\">Join us on this journey of turning ideas into reality and building the future of technology together.</p></div></div></article><div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200 max-w-3xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-start space-x-3 sm:space-x-4\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 sm:w-16 sm:h-16 rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 flex items-center justify-center\"><img alt=\"Buildora Team\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"object-contain\" src=\"/favicon.svg\" style=\"color: transparent;\"></div></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-0\">Buildora</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-base text-gray-600 mb-0 sm:mb-3\">The editorial team at Buildora.</p></div></div></div></div><section class=\"bg-gray-50 py-12 mt-12\" data-section=\"related-posts\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-0\"><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-8 text-center\">You might also like</h2><div class=\"grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"animate-fadeSlideUp\" style=\"animation-delay: 0ms; animation-fill-mode: both;\"><a class=\"group block transition-all duration-300\" href=\"/blog/from-code-to-career-hsbc-technology-hiring-hackathon-highlights\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden h-full flex flex-col border border-gray-200\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-48 rounded-t-2xl overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"From Code to Career: HSBC Technology Hiring Hackathon Highlights\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" src=\"/assets/0e108079b083c074.png\"></div><div class=\"p-4 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-2\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Buildora</span><span class=\"mx-2\">•</span><span>2 min read</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors line-clamp-1 leading-tight\">From Code to Career: HSBC Technology Hiring Hackathon Highlights</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed line-clamp-2 mb-3 flex-1\">The HSBC Technology Hackathon at T-Hub, Hyderabad brought together 120 top tech students for a 12-hour coding sprint. From 13K+ applications to 46 intern offers, discover how talent met opportunity in this hiring-focused innovation challenge.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-pink-100 text-pink-800\">Hackathons</span><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Oct 26, 2025</span></div><div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 lg:hidden\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14\"></path></svg></div></div></div></a></div><div class=\"animate-fadeSlideUp\" style=\"animation-delay: 150ms; animation-fill-mode: both;\"><a class=\"group block transition-all duration-300\" href=\"/blog/women-in-tech-building-the-future-shebuilds-2025\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden h-full flex flex-col border border-gray-200\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-48 rounded-t-2xl overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"SheBuilds Hackathon 2025 – Where Women Lead, Build, and Inspire\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" src=\"/assets/buildora/b1e3d8adfd1218cf.png\"></div><div class=\"p-4 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-2\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Buildora</span><span class=\"mx-2\">•</span><span>2 min read</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors line-clamp-1 leading-tight\">SheBuilds Hackathon 2025 – Where Women Lead, Build, and Inspire</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed line-clamp-2 mb-3 flex-1\">On August 1st and 2nd, 2025, Greater Noida became a hub of women-led innovation during SheBuilds 2025. This event was more than a hackathon; it was a movement highlighting women innovators shaping tomorrow's technology.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-pink-100 text-pink-800\">Hackathons</span><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Oct 26, 2025</span></div><div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 lg:hidden\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14\"></path></svg></div></div></div></a></div><div class=\"animate-fadeSlideUp\" style=\"animation-delay: 300ms; animation-fill-mode: both;\"><a class=\"group block transition-all duration-300\" href=\"/blog/great-bengaluru-hackathon-2025-success-story\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden h-full flex flex-col border border-gray-200\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-48 rounded-t-2xl overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"The Great Bengaluru Hackathon: Success Story - The Numbers That Will Surprise You\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" src=\"/assets/buildora/2535ab9df75a29b0.png\"></div><div class=\"p-4 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-2\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Buildora</span><span class=\"mx-2\">•</span><span>2 min read</span></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors line-clamp-1 leading-tight\">The Great Bengaluru Hackathon: Success Story - The Numbers That Will Surprise You</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed line-clamp-2 mb-3 flex-1\">The Great Bengaluru Hackathon 2025 united five premier engineering institutions, bringing together 500+ participants to tackle real-world challenges. Discover the remarkable innovations from SecureIT, LoanSaathi, and NammaYatriPlus.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-pink-100 text-pink-800\">Hackathons</span><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Mar 19, 2025</span></div><div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 lg:hidden\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14\"></path></svg></div></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"flex justify-center mt-8\"><a href=\"/blog\" class=\"\n            relative px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-medium text-sm text-white\n        